dispatched occurrence sta"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"rts in a fresh root Agent and Session, then leaves an
auditable record."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**Self-contained task + schedule + permission boundary → fresh root Agent + fresh Session + durable "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ned task + schedule + permission boundary → fresh root Agent + fresh Session + durable run history**"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Why automation · Features · Install · Quick start · Safety · Technical details"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**English** · 简体中文"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## 🎯 Why automation"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"DSH Core Schedule is the right tool for reminders in the current conversation: “come back to this Se"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ssion in ten minutes.” `dsh-automation` handles a different job: “run this complete task independent"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"ly every weekday and leave me a result I can inspect.”"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| | DSH Core Schedule | dsh-automation |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Execution context | Returns to the same live Agent | Starts a fresh root Agent and Session |
